  "releaseNotes": "New SerialTransport implementing ITransport for unified serial communication (Open/Close/Send/Receive/SendReceive). Adapted to IDriver async interface and ITransport spec. ControlRequest/ControlResult support.  新增SerialTransport实现ITransport统一串口通信，适配IDriver全异步接口与ITransport规范，支持ControlRequest/ControlResult控制接口。",
